<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Home Assistant 贡献者 blog: 应用市场</title><description>News for contributors to 应用市场.</description><link>https://www.hasscn.top/</link><item><title>将部分README内容排除在Marketplace之外</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/25/leave-readme-sections-out-of-the-marketplace/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/25/leave-readme-sections-out-of-the-marketplace/</guid><description>标记README中仅适用于GitHub的部分，如安装步骤和安装徽章，Marketplace将不会显示这些内容。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>marketplace</category></item><item><title>仪表盘卡片可以以 ZIP 文件形式发布</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/24/dashboard-cards-zip-files/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/24/dashboard-cards-zip-files/</guid><description>从 Home Assistant 2026.12 开始，Marketplace 可以从一个 ZIP 文件安装仪表盘卡片。如何发布这样的文件，以及为什么目前需要保留一个备用方案。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>marketplace</category><category>frontend</category></item><item><title>集成现在有了分类</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/10/20/integration-categories/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/10/20/integration-categories/</guid><description>集成现在会说明其用途，例如照明或能源。这对你的 manifest 意味着什么，以及自定义集成如何参与其中。</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>core</category><category>marketplace</category></item></channel></rss>